	"data": "Cover Letter Christopher DiCarlo Mindojo\n\nJuly 14, 2020\nRe: Mobile Game Developer - Eastern Europe\nDear Hiring Manager,\nI am applying for the position of Mobile Game Developer at Mindojo.\nI am very interested in this position posted on Glassdoor. I believe I am a solid fit for this work, including experience with Unity, a strong foundation in computer science, and experience designing, writing, and testing code.\nI have been studying and developing programs with Unity for the last couple of…",
